# townjump-dist

Direct downloads of townjump @VERSION@. This repository is generated by the release workflow: do not edit it by hand,
the next release replaces its contents (the apt repository under `linux/debian/` is kept).

The file names carry no version; the current version is in `version.txt`.

| Folder | Files |
| --- | --- |
| `macos/` | `townjump-macos-aarch64.tar.gz`, `townjump-macos-x86_64.tar.gz` |
| `linux/` | `townjump-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`, `townjump-linux-aarch64.tar.gz`, `townjump-linux-armv7hf.tar.gz` (hard float), `townjump-linux-armv7sf.tar.gz` (soft float), `townjump-linux-mipsel.tar.gz`, `townjump-linux-mips.tar.gz` |
| `linux/debian/` | apt repository |
| `android/` | `townjump-termux-aarch64.tar.gz` (Termux) |
| `windows/` | `townjump.exe`, `townjump-setup.exe` (installer) |
| (root) | `SHA256SUMS`, `version.txt` |

Base URL: `https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-dist/`

## Install

macOS (Apple silicon; use `x86_64` on Intel) and Linux (pick your architecture):

    curl -fsSL https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-dist/linux/townjump-linux-x86_64.tar.gz | tar -xz
    sudo install -m 755 townjump-*/townjump /usr/local/bin/townjump

Termux:

    curl -fsSL https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-dist/android/townjump-termux-aarch64.tar.gz | tar -xz --strip-components=1 -C "$PREFIX/bin" --wildcards '*/townjump'

Windows: download `windows/townjump-setup.exe` and run it, or take `windows/townjump.exe` alone.

## Other channels

- GitHub Releases: https://github.com/mesh-town/townjump/releases
- Homebrew: `brew install mesh-town/macos/townjump`
- winget: `winget install MeshTown.Townjump`
- apt: https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-dist/linux/debian
- OpenWrt feed: https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-openwrt/
- Keenetic feed: https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-keenetic/
- Container image: `ghcr.io/mesh-town/townjump`

## Verify

Download `SHA256SUMS` and check a file against it, from the folder that holds the downloaded file's path:

    curl -fsSLO https://mesh-town.github.io/townjump-dist/SHA256SUMS
    grep ' linux/townjump-linux-x86_64.tar.gz$' SHA256SUMS
    sha256sum townjump-linux-x86_64.tar.gz
